{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31374","headline":"秋日登越王楼献于中丞 · 李渥","name":"秋日登越王楼献于中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越王曾牧劒南州，因向城隅建此楼。\n横玉远开千峤雪，暗雷下听一江流。\n画檐先弄朝阳色，朱槛低临衆木秋。\n徒学仲宣聊四望，且将词赋好依刘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李渥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}